{
  "format": "souls-form-cases/1",
  "about": "eden:card_hand (SA-X16, #2911): a hand's count of cards is seen only by the Soul linked as its player (SA-F8, #2947). The pack argument is given resolved. Asked by the player, the asker sees linked:player; asked by anyone else, a need on the hand is unknown.",
